  "details": "Currently.\n The uploaded avatars open in a \"expanded\" state. If you scroll halfway through your list to find an avatar, close your menu and then reopen up your avatar list. It will have gone back to the start of the list instead of where you last placed it. \nPreviously uploaded avatars opened in a \"collapsed\" state and scrolling through the list, closing the menu and reopening it. Left you at the last avatar you looked at last.\nWith expanding and collapsing the list reverting it back to the start. \nTLDR: Opening your uploaded avatar list always shows the last uploaded avatar first. Previously you could scroll to a past avatar, close the menu, open it again and not have to scroll again.",
